(114, 1, NULL, 'assistant', 'Answer based on indexed notebook content:\n\n[Provincial Risk Assessment 2026]\nProvincial risk assessment highlights delayed barangay reporting, uneven resource allocation, and inconsistent evacuation triggers. Recommended focus areas include budget alignment, floodgate readiness, and barangay communication escalation procedures.\n\n---\n\n[Municipal Coordination Brief]\nMunicipal coordination brief recommends a unified reporting template, clearer budget accountabilities, and synchronized operating timelines for LGUs. It also recommends standard action ownership and escalation checkpoints.\n\n---\n\n[Inter-Agency Meeting Recording]\nMeeting discussion emphasized communication bottlenecks, public advisory timing, and the need for an action tracker for field implementers. Participants requested a concise brief with lead offices and deadlines.\n\nRequested prompt: provide Information about Agra AMICUS', '[{\"source_id\":1,\"source_name\":\"Provincial Risk Assessment 2026\",\"type\":\"pdf\"},{\"source_id\":2,\"source_name\":\"Municipal Coordination Brief\",\"type\":\"docx\"},{\"source_id\":3,\"source_name\":\"Inter-Agency Meeting Recording\",\"type\":\"video\"}]', '{\"provider\":\"local-fallback\",\"mode\":\"qa\"}', 0, '2026-05-19 03:55:31', '2026-05-19 03:55:31'),
