(144, 1, NULL, 'assistant', 'Based on the provided document, here is the extracted content of **CS Form No. 6, Revised 2020 (Application for Leave)**:\n\n### **1. General Information & Application Fields**\n*   **Office/Department**\n*   **Name:** (Last, First, Middle)\n*   **Date of Filing**\n*   **Position**\n*   **Salary**\n\n### **2. Details of Application (Section 6)**\n*   **6.A Type of Leave to be Availed Of:**\n    *   Vacation Leave\n    *   Mandatory/Forced Leave\n    *   Sick Leave\n    *   Maternity Leave\n    *   Paternity Leave\n    *   Special Privilege Leave\n    *   Solo Parent Leave\n    *   Study Leave\n    *   10-Day VAWC Leave\n    *   Rehabilitation Privilege\n    *   Special Emergency (Calamity) Leave\n    *   Adoption Leave\n    *   Special Leave Benefits for Women\n    *   Others (Monetization of Leave Credits, Terminal Leave)\n*   **6.B Details of Leave:**\n    *   *Vacation/Special Privilege:* Within the Philippines or Abroad (Specify)\n    *   *Sick Leave:* In Hospital (Specify Illness) or Out Patient (Specify Illness)\n    *   *Special Leave Benefits for Women:* Specify Illness\n    *   *Study Leave:* Completion of Master\'s Degree, BAR/Board Examination Review, or Other purpose\n*   **6.C Number of Working Days Applied For** (including Inclusive Dates)\n*   **6.D Commutation:** Requested or Not Requested\n\n### **3. Details of Action on Application (Section 7)**\n*   **7.A Certification of Leave Credits:** Vacation and Sick Leave balances (Total Earned, Less this application, Balance) as of a specific date.\n*   **7.B Recommendation:** For approval or disapproval (with reasons).\n*   **7.C Approved For:** Number of days with pay, days without pay, or others.\n*   **7.D Disapproved Due To:** Specific reasons for disapproval.\n\n---\n\n### **4. Instructions and Requirements per Leave Type**\nApplications must be submitted in at least duplicate. For leaves of 30 calendar days or more and terminal leave, a clearance from money, property, and work-related accountabilities is required.\n\n*   **Vacation Leave:** File 5 days in advance, if possible. Specify if travel is within the Philippines or abroad.\n*   **Mandatory/Forced Leave:** Annual 5-day leave; forfeited if not taken. VL of 1 day or more counts toward compliance.\n*   **Sick Leave:** File immediately upon return. If filed in advance or exceeding 5 days, a medical certificate or affidavit is required.\n*   **Maternity Leave (105 days):** Requires proof of pregnancy (ultrasound/doctor\'s certificate) and CS Form No. 6a (if allocating credits).\n*   **Paternity Leave (7 days):** Requires proof of child’s delivery (birth certificate, medical certificate, and marriage contract).\n*   **Special Privilege Leave (3 days):** File at least 1 week prior (except emergencies).\n*   **Solo Parent Leave (7 days):** File 5 days in advance, if possible, with an updated Solo Parent ID.\n*   **Study Leave (up to 6 months):** Requires meeting internal agency requirements and a signed contract.\n*   **VAWC Leave (10 days):** File in advance or upon return. Requires a BPO, TPO/PPO, certification of filing, or a police report with a medical certificate.\n*   **Rehabilitation Leave (up to 6 months):** Apply within 1 week of the accident. Requires a letter request, police/relevant reports, medical certificate, and government physician concurrence (if using a private doctor).\n*   **Special Leave Benefits for Women (up to 2 months):** File 5 days prior to scheduled gynecological surgery (or immediately upon return for emergencies). Requires a medical certificate, clinical summary, histopathological report, operative technique, and estimated recuperation period.\n*   **Special Emergency (Calamity) Leave (up to 5 days):** Apply within 30 days of the calamity (straight or staggered). Granted once a year; requires residency and calamity declaration validation.\n*   **Monetization of Leave Credits:** For 50% or more of accumulated credits, a letter request stating valid reasons is required.\n*   **Terminal Leave:** Requires proof of resignation, retirement, or separation.\n*   **Adoption Leave:** Requires an authenticated copy of the Pre-Adoptive Placement Authority from the DSWD.', '[{\"source_id\":24,\"source_name\":\"CS Form No. 6, Revised 2020 (Application for Leave) (Secured).pdf\",\"type\":\"pdf\"}]', '{\"provider\":\"gemini\",\"mode\":\"qa\"}', 0, '2026-05-19 17:18:00', '2026-05-19 17:18:00'),
