(183, 23, NULL, 'user', 'who is batman', NULL, '{\"mode\":\"qa\",\"selected_source_ids\":null}', 0, '2026-05-20 16:12:38', '2026-05-20 16:12:38'),
(184, 23, NULL, 'assistant', 'Batman is one of the most iconic superheroes in the world, appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics. He was created by writer Bill Finger and artist Bob Kane, first debuting in \"Detective Comics\" #27 on March 30, 1939.\n\nHere\'s a breakdown of who Batman is:\n\n*   **Secret Identity:** Batman\'s secret identity is **Bruce Wayne**, a wealthy American industrialist, philanthropist, and socialite who lives in the fictional Gotham City. He maintains a public image of a superficial playboy to avert suspicion from his crime-fighting activities.\n\n*   **Origin Story:** The driving force behind Batman\'s existence is a profound tragedy. As a child, Bruce Wayne witnessed the brutal murder of his parents, Thomas and Martha Wayne, during a mugging. This traumatic event led him to dedicate his life to fighting crime and seeking justice, vowing to \"war on all criminals\" to prevent similar tragedies from happening to others.\n\n*   **No Superpowers:** Unlike many other superheroes, Batman possesses no superhuman abilities. Instead, he relies on his peak human physical and mental conditioning, genius-level intellect, detective skills, and mastery of various martial arts. He is often regarded as one of the world\'s greatest detectives.\n\n*   **Skills and Resources:** Bruce Wayne uses his inexhaustible wealth to fund his crime-fighting endeavors, giving him access to advanced technologies, vehicles (like the Batmobile and Batplane), and a vast arsenal of gadgets. He trains himself physically and intellectually to near perfection.\n\n*   **Persona and Moral Code:** He crafts a bat-inspired persona to strike fear into the hearts of criminals. Despite having the potential to harm his enemies, a defining characteristic of Batman is his strong commitment to justice and his strict moral code against taking a life.\n\n*   **Allies and Rogues Gallery:** Batman is supported by loyal allies such as his butler and father figure, Alfred Pennyworth, Commissioner James Gordon, and various sidekicks like Robin and Batgirl. He faces a notorious rogues\' gallery of villains, including the Joker, the Penguin, the Riddler, Two-Face, and Catwoman.\n\n*   **Role in the DC Universe:** Batman is a central figure in the DC Universe, often serving as a member or leader of teams like the Justice League. He operates primarily in Gotham City as its vigilant protector and \"Dark Knight.\"', '[{\"source_id\":null,\"source_name\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"type\":\"web\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com\\/grounding-api-redirect\\/AUZIYQFNozmVGe1aAybA0PtMEoswGi6BbgbeDtAG5Bjl52TYz48LlV7jW_l5H9KgXYPh_4RnkQ3BLnLJkBX06oHvXOBxbah-LX9V4KtecKfn0Unksld7u70uCAqTRdA29MmGAg==\"},{\"source_id\":null,\"source_name\":\"fandom.com\",\"type\":\"web\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com\\/grounding-api-redirect\\/AUZIYQHJ0kV_EGPecehdt8ktAeVR3tnndcRsnykGS8xff6nBSN6xForCKzjMDItG0UhnzGNSIgSl5f-EHBYFKpNzn0-HSas-5SfrGyjpR9CyOVNx3Mug6Y0mxf8zfL40oTPxu5_kAJ44Kw==\"},{\"source_id\":null,\"source_name\":\"dc.com\",\"type\":\"web\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com\\/grounding-api-redirect\\/AUZIYQFx5FBEjWbwak-IYOaUNm9oWDF7uNZhm5UNXyk1zwjEapXPIsMbXfwxTCPdFdE3oFj1JXVK3cAEBW72wxmE4c84Mfy60EpcU9BNNE5xODzrxD2lL5nIvJBHr0AmBVQO6w==\"},{\"source_id\":null,\"source_name\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"type\":\"web\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com\\/grounding-api-redirect\\/AUZIYQGhsgCtlFRCYoVt5BUKub3MI7gGC1U_g5nddPBiakCYtaIio2CE_dYN27xuzqAr5qkt_-hu580N6aDInessvnLKSoQx9-lZ-x3_QWJDEJ8L4Q0yUPuky8BPFuWsesQe69RuNwyq98Swy2M=\"},{\"source_id\":null,\"source_name\":\"rutgers.edu\",\"type\":\"web\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com\\/grounding-api-redirect\\/AUZIYQFowwezwqW0eZ9SpcZO4h1LAaaXmoIrMt7kGGKl7TXf-1gG0N8cqcBoiUO1C2dmwoXuHPN13k3biUYwsfx-jPZoIzJJYfs6_qNJ97EWy1_QsXNqGC_QnFzhxtl5LjzXqHnabmVCS1G-zf3IJlxiMqT1EA==\"},{\"source_id\":null,\"source_n