(186, 23, NULL, 'assistant', 'Based on the provided document, the file is a publication (3rd Edition, dated February 22, 2026) focusing on local government law and local autonomy in the Philippines. \n\nThe document contains the following sections and information:\n\n### 1. Core Contents\n* **Updated Reviewer:** A reviewer on Local Government Law and Local Autonomy, integrating relevant Supreme Court decisions up to December 2025.\n* **Codal and Statutory Texts:** The full text of the 1991 Local Government Code, its Implementing Rules and Regulations (IRR), and 15 amendatory laws.\n* **Compendium and Opinions:** A topical compendium of case digests covering 1,168 Supreme Court decisions (from 1900 to December 31, 2025) and a summary of Department of the Interior and Local Government (DILG) opinions (from 1992 to 2025).\n\n### 2. Messages of Support\nThe publication features official endorsements and messages of support from key leaders of various local government leagues:\n* **Governor Dax Cua:** National President of the Union of Local Authorities of the Philippines (ULAP) and Governor of the Province of Quirino.\n* **Governor Reynaldo S. Tamayo, Jr.:** National President of the League of Provinces of the Philippines (LPP) and Governor of South Cotabato.\n* **Mayor Francis Zamora:** National President of the League of Cities of the Philippines (LCP) and Mayor of San Juan City.\n* **Mayor Faustino \"Inno\" Dy V:** National President of the League of Municipalities of the Philippines (LMP) and Mayor of Echague, Isabela.\n* **Hon. Maria Katrina Jessica G. Dy:** National President of the Liga ng mga Barangay sa Pilipinas.\n\n### 3. Preface\nAn introductory text explaining the three core pillars of the eBook, the relationship between local autonomy and public accountability, and the target audience (local and national government officials, lawyers, law students, and the general public).\n\n### 4. Authors and Contributors\n* **Co-Authors:** Janelle A. Sy and Gilbert Charles K. Tiong.\n* **Contributors to the 2nd Edition (2021):** Jesus B. Doque IV, Clarisse Aeaea M. Kilboy, and Rose Shayne T. Dua.', '[{\"source_id\":29,\"source_name\":\"Agra AMICUS 2026.pdf\",\"type\":\"pdf\",\"source_url\":null}]', '{\"provider\":\"gemini\",\"mode\":\"qa\",\"used_sources\":true,\"uploaded_sources_count\":1,\"uploaded_source_names\":[\"Agra AMICUS 2026.pdf\"],\"web_sources_count\":0,\"web_source_urls\":[]}', 0, '2026-05-20 16:13:48', '2026-05-20 16:13:48'),
