(188, 23, NULL, 'assistant', 'Spider-Man is one of the most beloved and iconic superheroes in the world! He\'s a fictional character, a comic book superhero created by writer-editor Stan Lee and artist Steve Ditko. He first appeared in the anthology comic book *Amazing Fantasy #15* in August 1962.\n\nHere\'s a quick rundown of who Spider-Man is:\n\n*   **Secret Identity:** His real name is **Peter Parker**. He\'s typically portrayed as an orphan raised by his Aunt May and Uncle Ben in New York City.\n*   **Origin Story:** Peter was a shy, academically brilliant high school student who was bitten by a radioactive spider during a science exhibition. This bite granted him incredible spider-like abilities.\n*   **Powers and Abilities:**\n    *   **Superhuman Strength:** He can lift many times his own weight.\n    *   **Superhuman Agility and Reflexes:** He\'s incredibly fast and agile, able to dodge bullets and move with incredible grace.\n    *   **Wall-Crawling:** He can stick to most surfaces, allowing him to climb walls and ceilings.\n    *   **Spider-Sense:** This is a crucial ability! It\'s a precognitive \"sixth sense\" that warns him of impending danger, often appearing as a tingling sensation in his head.\n    *   **Web-Shooters:** While not an inherent power, Peter invents and builds mechanical devices called \"web-shooters\" that allow him to fire strong, adhesive web fluid, which he uses to swing through the city and apprehend criminals.\n*   **Personality and Motivation:** What makes Spider-Man so relatable and enduring is his personality. He\'s known for his witty banter, sarcastic humor, and constant struggle to balance his superhero life with his ordinary life, dealing with everyday problems like paying rent, school, and relationships. His famous motto, \"With great power comes great responsibility,\" instilled in him by his Uncle Ben, guides his heroic actions.\n*   **Impact:** Spider-Man quickly became a cultural phenomenon, resonating with readers because he was a teenager dealing with real-world problems alongside his superheroics, unlike many other established heroes at the time. He\'s been featured in countless comic books, animated series, live-action films, video games, and merchandise.\n\nEssentially, he\'s the friendly neighborhood superhero who uses his incredible powers to protect the innocent, all while trying to navigate the complexities of being a normal person. Pretty cool, right?', '[]', '{\"provider\":\"gemini-conversational\",\"mode\":\"qa\",\"used_sources\":false,\"uploaded_sources_count\":0,\"uploaded_source_names\":[],\"web_sources_count\":0,\"web_source_urls\":[]}', 0, '2026-05-20 16:15:01', '2026-05-20 16:15:01'),
