(190, 23, NULL, 'assistant', 'Batman is one of the most iconic superheroes in the world, a creation of DC Comics! He\'s a fascinating character with a rich history.\n\nAt his core, Batman is Bruce Wayne, a billionaire industrialist and philanthropist from Gotham City. What makes him unique among many superheroes is that he doesn\'t have any superpowers. Instead, he relies on his incredible intellect, peak physical conditioning, detective skills, martial arts mastery, advanced technology, and an unwavering will to fight crime.\n\nHis origin story is quite tragic and central to his character: as a young boy, Bruce witnessed the brutal murder of his parents, Thomas and Martha Wayne, in an alley. This traumatic event fueled his lifelong crusade against crime. He dedicated his life to training his mind and body to perfection, eventually adopting the persona of Batman to strike fear into the hearts of criminals, inspired by a bat that flew into his study.\n\nHe\'s often referred to as the \"Dark Knight\" or the \"World\'s Greatest Detective.\" While he has a strict moral code against killing, he\'s known for his somewhat darker, grittier approach to justice compared to some other heroes. He operates out of the Batcave, a secret lair beneath his mansion, and is often aided by his loyal butler Alfred Pennyworth, and sometimes by allies like Robin, Batgirl, and Commissioner Gordon.\n\nBatman has been featured in countless comic books, television shows, animated series, video games, and blockbuster movies, making him a truly enduring figure in popular culture!', '[]', '{\"provider\":\"gemini-conversational\",\"mode\":\"qa\",\"used_sources\":false,\"uploaded_sources_count\":0,\"uploaded_source_names\":[],\"web_sources_count\":0,\"web_source_urls\":[]}', 0, '2026-05-20 16:20:32', '2026-05-20 16:20:32'),
