(204, 23, NULL, 'assistant', 'The Avengers are one of Marvel\'s most iconic superhero teams, known as \"Earth\'s Mightiest Heroes.\" They have a rich history spanning both comic books and a highly successful cinematic universe.\n\nHere\'s a breakdown of information about the Avengers:\n\n**In Marvel Comics:**\nThe Avengers first appeared in *The Avengers* #1 in September 1963. The team was created by the legendary writer-editor Stan Lee and artist/co-plotter Jack Kirby. The original lineup consisted of Iron Man, Ant-Man (Hank Pym), Hulk, Thor, and Wasp. Captain America, a prominent figure, joined the team in issue #4 after being discovered trapped in ice and revived.\n\nUnlike some other superhero teams, the Avengers were conceived as an \"all-star ensemble\" of existing Marvel characters who typically operated independently but would unite to face threats too formidable for any single hero. Over the decades, the roster has been fluid, with many heroes joining and leaving the team, often more than once. They have battled numerous powerful villains, including Loki, Ultron, and Kang the Conqueror.\n\n**In the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU):**\nThe Avengers are the central superhero team in the Marvel Cinematic Universe, a shared cinematic universe envisioned by producer Kevin Feige, similar to the interconnectedness of the comic books. The team made their live-action film debut in *The Avengers* (2012).\n\nThe Avengers\' journey in the MCU has been chronicled across several blockbuster films:\n*   *Marvel\'s The Avengers* (2012)\n*   *Avengers: Age of Ultron* (2015)\n*   *Captain America: Civil War* (2016) – which depicted a significant conflict and split within the team\n*   *Avengers: Infinity War* (2018)\n*   *Avengers: Endgame* (2019) – which concluded \"The Infinity Saga\" (Phases 1-3 of the MCU)\n\nThe Avengers films have been incredibly successful, becoming one of the highest-grossing film franchises of all time and influencing other studios to create their own shared superhero universes. The MCU is currently in \"The Multiverse Saga\" (Phases 4-6), with new Avengers films like *Avengers: Doomsday* (2026) and *Avengers: Secret Wars* (2027) planned to conclude this saga.\n\n**Key Members:**\nWhile the roster has changed frequently, some of the most iconic and foundational members across both comics and the MCU include:\n*   Iron Man (Tony Stark)\n*   Captain America (Steve Rogers)\n*   Thor\n*   Hulk (Bruce Banner)\n*   Black Widow (Natasha Romanoff)\n*   Hawkeye (Clint Barton)\n*   Ant-Man (Hank Pym in comics, Scott Lang in MCU)\n*   Wasp (Janet van Dyne in comics, Hope van Dyne in MCU)\n*   Scarlet Witch (Wanda Maximoff)\n*   Vision\n*   Black Panther (T\'Challa)\n*   Captain Marvel (Carol Danvers)', '[{\"source_id\":null,\"source_name\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"type\":\"web\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com\\/grounding-api-redirect\\/AUZIYQEM-AzJGRYVIHMephFf_OY76lKpGI20CcVGcCnqeCarfMm61JIZxlKLzF4tkMlNX0L38jSv1pW4ThrTxxoxmoflVUx-pA8o6cfsEjCkNiuvjvvGXDm6-ZMxNgeYNCp4RHFqcRtgKZ9xpjo=\"},{\"source_id\":null,\"source_name\":\"ebsco.com\",\"type\":\"web\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com\\/grounding-api-redirect\\/AUZIYQH3EqgjubBlQmCWAdBlyeTxlorOKzcowxe9pHrSNrMlNOJ8rP8rGltgM9jP6eu8YLrzI2jpNwTe9TWXwn7hYAjTWlLc39g3moju33Hsq7BbxhbpjglQumtZnqgBpZN4sKNX159HhzICimHtFHKNSj_AMFFPuz78mGxmPtU6HDsQjgyLUbVgH9kG\"},{\"source_id\":null,\"source_name\":\"comicbookquest.com\",\"type\":\"web\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com\\/grounding-api-redirect\\/AUZIYQHcLm2R-1djsIV-u5E6NufbgFTGQTyRBxQRGtBqglzQ9NnacDU_YGuRaW5h_6guZdorwmsdtgVfm0ytwXChuBq-_yh8IlfprYyTAv46Oxapt_NCVvhlYDApwz89RVt8J7x1AJ3mzYLSSTPv-9KaBrVcofN-ChkIMVdQvizcRfW8uKc7nCMZqQ37rHi_lgz4QpAlI_BX683DWPb6FDryQJYrG7yULTU=\"},{\"source_id\":null,\"source_name\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"type\":\"web\",\"source_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com\\/grounding-api-redirect\\/AUZIYQF1VWiDv_GnS-JPyG9mfjVP