tion 103 AppendixE Use-CaseDiagram 104 AppendixF SystemUsabilityScale(SUS)QuestionnaireGuide SystemEvaluationAccordingtoDesign 5 (SA) 4 (A) 3 (N) 2 (D) 1 (SD) 1.Thesystem’sinterfaceisvisuallyappealing. 2.Thetext,icons,andbuttonsareclearand readable. 3.Thelayoutofthesystemiswell-organized. 4.Thecolorschemeandfontsusedareappropriate andconsistent. 5.Theoverallvisualdesignenhancesmyexperience usingthesystem. SystemEvaluationAccordingtoNavigation 5 (SA) 4 (A) 3 (N) 2 (D) 1 (SD) 1.Itiseasytomovebetweendifferentpagesofthe system. 2.IcanfindthefeaturesandtoolsIneedwithout difficulty. 3.Themenusandnavigationelementsareclear andunderstandable. 4.Itiseasytoreturntopreviouspagesoractions. 5.Icanaccomplishmytasksquicklybecausethe navigationisstraightforward. SystemEvaluationAccordingtoUser- Friendliness 5 (SA) 4 (A) 3 (N) 2 (D) 1 (SD) 1.Thesystemiscomfortableandpleasanttouse. 2.First-timeuserscanlearnthesystemeasily. 3.Theinstructionsandlabelsinthesystemare easytounderstand. 4.Ifeelconfidentusingthesystemwithlittleto noassistance. 5.Thesystemmakesmytaskseasierandmore convenienttocomplete. 105 SystemEvaluationAccordingtoUsability 5 (SA) 4 (A) 3 (N) 2 (D) 1 (SD) 1.Thesystemiseasytooperateanduse. 2.Thesystem’sfeaturesfunctionasexpected. 3.Icancompletetaskswithoutunnecessary steps. 4.Thesystemrespondsquicklytomyactions. 5.Icanusethesystemeffectivelyevenwithout priorexperience. 106 AppendixG CurriculumVitae 107 108 109', '2026-05-19 17:22:47', '2026-05-19 17:22:47', '2026-05-19 17:22:45', '2026-05-19 17:22:47');
