(26, 21, NULL, 'pdf', 'PETAlink_Manuscript_KathStone.pdf', 'PETAlink_Manuscript_KathStone.pdf', 'public', 'notebooks/21/sources/V08kqrBVADZNSK0nt8WM8dqRogO4EIZK3yMDSJci.pdf', NULL, 'application/pdf', 6155753, 'indexed', 'cbfefa899e93f30d5ae466bfd8fbf1a9a9d04dca', '{\"notes\":null,\"extension\":\"pdf\",\"scan_completed_at\":\"2026-05-20T01:23:07+00:00\",\"scan_status\":\"completed\",\"is_file_upload\":true,\"file_type_detected\":\"pdf\",\"file_extension\":\"pdf\",\"mime_type\":\"application\\/pdf\",\"file_size_bytes\":6155753,\"file_size_human\":\"5.87 MB\",\"file_hash_sha1\":\"cbfefa899e93f30d5ae466bfd8fbf1a9a9d04dca\",\"file_hash_md5\":\"d88f88957fcb9211a9eb5f6b1055bb34\",\"security_scan\":{\"status\":\"clean\",\"threats_found\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"scan_timestamp\":\"2026-05-20T01:23:07+00:00\"},\"format_specifications\":{\"type\":\"pdf\",\"extension\":\"pdf\",\"pdf_version\":\"\",\"page_count\":119,\"title\":\"\",\"author\":\"Mark Ezekiel Zareno\",\"subject\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"creator\":\"WPS Writer\",\"creation_date\":\"2026-01-29T07:03:14+08:00\",\"modification_date\":\"2026-01-29T07:03:14+08:00\"},\"content_structure\":{\"type\":\"pdf\",\"line_count\":34625,\"word_count\":952042,\"character_count\":6155753,\"estimated_reading_time_minutes\":4761},\"file_last_modified\":\"2026-05-20T01:23:07+00:00\",\"file_is_readable\":true,\"file_is_writable\":true,\"word_count\":5044,\"character_count\":119503,\"extracted_text_full_length\":119503}', 'i PETAlink:AnOnlineCustomerDigitalPortalforFlowerShopOwnersinDagupan City SchoolofInformationTechnologyEducation UniversidaddeDagupan ArellanoSt.,DagupanCity BACHELOROFSCIENCEININFORMATIONTECHNOLOGY DAROY,KATHLEENCHARMQ. MEDRANO,PATRICKS. SORIANO,RAHMYRHICSSONL. ZARENO,MARKEZEKIELG. December2025 ii APPROVALSHEET InpartialfulfillmentoftherequirementsleadingtothedegreeofBACHELOR OFSCIENCEININFORMATIONTECHNOLOGY,thecomp...', 'i PETAlink:AnOnlineCustomerDigitalPortalforFlowerShopOwnersinDagupan City SchoolofInformationTechnologyEducation UniversidaddeDagupan ArellanoSt.,DagupanCity BACHELOROFSCIENCEININFORMATIONTECHNOLOGY DAROY,KATHLEENCHARMQ. MEDRANO,PATRICKS. SORIANO,RAHMYRHICSSONL. ZARENO,MARKEZEKIELG. December2025 ii APPROVALSHEET InpartialfulfillmentoftherequirementsleadingtothedegreeofBACHELOR OFSCIENCEININFORMATIONTECHNOLOGY,thecompletedprojectstudy entitled,PETAlink:AnOnlineCustomerDigitalPortalforFlowerShopOwnersin DagupanCity,preparedandsubmittedbyDaroy,KathleenCharmQ.,Zareno,Mark EzekielG.,Medrano,PatrickS.,Soriano,RahmYrhicssonL.,isendorsedfor approvalandacceptance. KYLEDITRIG.MORENO,MIT Adviser Thisistocertifythatthecompletedprojectstudymentionedabovesubmittedby Daroy,KathleenCharmQ.,Zareno,MarkEzekielG.,Medrano,PatrickS.,Soriano, RahmYrhicssonL.,hasbeenexaminedandapprovedonDECEMBER15,2025bythe OralExaminationCommittee. JANNALFREDA.QUINTO,MSIB Chairman EVANGELINEN.LACHICA,MIT BENITAL.BIALA,MIT Member Member ROBERTHS.LLOREN Member Acceptedandapprovedaspartialfulfillmentoftherequirementsforthe degreeofBACHELOROFSCIENCEININFORMATIONTECHNOLOGYon DECEMBER15.2025,withaGradeofPASSED. JANNALFREDA.QUINTO,MSIB Dean,SchoolofInformationTechnologyEducation iii ABSTRACT KathleenCharmQ.Daroy,PatrickS.Medrano,RahmYrhicssonL.Soriano,Mark EzekielG.Zareno,PETAlink:AnOnlineCustomerDigitalPortalforFlowerShop OwnersinDagupanCity,BachelorofScienceinInformationTechnology,Schoolof InformationTechnologyEducation,UniversidaddeDagupan,ArellanoSt.,DagupanCity, Pangasinan,Philippines. Adviser:KYLEDITRIG.MORENO,MIT ThiscapstonestudypresentsthedevelopmentandevaluationofPetaLink:An OnlineCustomerDigitalPortalforFlowerShopOwnersinDagupanCity,aweb-based systemdesignedtoimprovecustomerinteractionandoperationalefficiencyamonglocal flowershops.Thestudyaddressesthechallengesofmanualandtime-consuming processesinhandlingcustomerinquiries,browsingofflowerproducts,andorder coordination.ByintegratingMapsAPI,thesystemallowsuserstoviewthephysical locationsofparticipatingflowershops,helpingcustomerseasilyidentifynearbyshops andnavigatetotheirpreferredlocations.Thisfeatureenhancesaccessibilityandlocation awareness,supportingbetterservicecoordinationandimprovingtheoveralluser experiencebyprovidingaccurateandinteractivemap-basedinformationwithinthe platform.UsingtheSoftwareDevelopmentLifeCycle(SDLC)—specificallytheRapid ApplicationDevelopment(RAD)methodology—thedevelopersfollowedaniterative approachconsistingofanalysisandquickdesign,prototypedevelopment,testing,and implementation.Thisapproachenabledcontinuoususerfeedback,fasterdevelopment cycles,andtimelyrefinementofsystemfeaturestoensurethatPetaLinkmetthe functionalandusabilityrequirementsofflowershopownersandcustomers.Theusability ofPetaLink:AnOnlineCustomerDigitalPortalforFlowerShopOwnersinDagupan CitywasevaluatedusingtheSystemUsabilityScale(SUS)withWeightedMeanand LikertScale.Thesystemscoredhighinusability(4.76),design(4.78),navigation(4.78), anduser-friendliness(4.80),indicatingitisintuitive,visuallyappealing,andeasytouse. TheseresultsdemonstratethatPetaLinkenhancestheorderingworkflowforboth customersandshopowners.Thedevelopersrecommendfutureenhancementsincludinga brighter,moreappealinguserinterface,adedicatedmobileapplication,expansion beyondDagupanCity,subscription-basedselleraccounts,acustomer-assistancechatbot, andintegrationofsecureonlinepaymentoptionstofurtherimproveusability, accessibility,andoverallfunctionality. Keywords:SystemUsabilityScale(SUS),RapidApplicationDevelopment(RAD),Web- BasedPortal,MapsAPI,DigitalOrderingSystem,CustomerManagement iv ACKNOWLEDGEMENT Firstandforemost,wegivethankstoGodAlmighty,thesourceofourstrength, wisdom,andperseverancethroughoutthisproject.Wewouldliketoexpressourdeepest gratitudetoourformeradviser,Mr.YuriRancudo,forhisguidanceandsupportduring theinitialphaseofthisstudy.Oursincereappreciationisextendedtoouradviser,Mr. KyleditriG.Moreno,forhiscontinuousguidance,constructivefeedback,and encouragement.Wearealsothankfultoourtechnicaladviser,Mr.BenjieF.Zarate, whoseexpertiseandassistancesignif